; test_topology_run.ml: `forge run` / `forge run --processes` / `forge topology
; export` on examples/topology_app, a two-pool topology app with a generated
; `main` (distributed-deploys build step 3). Real native compiles and real
; processes, so it takes test_procs' hermetic shape, plus FORGE_TEST_BIN (it
; runs forge itself) and the example project, copied to a scratch dir.
